    "body": "Raise H200 DSpark CUDA graph capture to a minimum of 64 for c1/c2/c4 subagent fan-out. Preserve c8+ sizing, the full AgentX trace, synthetic AL 3.51, and Engram UVA. B300 c1 evidence: [CI](https://github.com/SemiAnalysisAI/InferenceX/actions/runs/34826137970), ITL P90/P99 38.74/41.42 \u2192 2.62/3.45 ms; other points require sweep validation.\n\n\u5c06 H200 DSpark \u7684 CUDA graph \u6700\u5c0f\u6355\u83b7\u8303\u56f4\u8bbe\u4e3a 64\uff0c\u4ee5\u8986\u76d6 c1/c2/c4 \u5b50\u4ee3\u7406\u5e76\u53d1\u3002\u4fdd\u6301 c8+ \u5927\u5c0f\u3001\u5b8c\u6574 AgentX \u8f68\u8ff9\u3001\u5408\u6210 AL 3.51 \u548c Engram UVA\uff1bB300 c1 \u5df2\u9a8c\u8bc1\u6539\u5584\uff0c\u5176\u4ed6\u70b9\u7531 sweep \u9a8c\u8bc1\u3002\n\nValidation / \u9a8c\u8bc1\uff1a12 behavioral tests, Bash syntax, exact c1/c2/c4 matrix / 12 \u9879\u884c\u4e3a\u6d4b\u8bd5\u3001Bash \u8bed\u6cd5\u53ca\u7cbe\u786e c1/c2/c4 \u77e9\u9635\u3002\n\n<!-- CURSOR_SUMMARY -->\n---\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> **Medium Risk**\n> Changes vLLM CUDA graph sizing for a production AgentX benchmark recipe; wrong capture bounds could affect latency/throughput or startup, though scope is limited to H200 launcher env and defaults elsewhere stay at 1.\n> \n> **Overview**\n> **Raises the CUDA graph capture floor for H200 DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash DSpark AgentX runs** so low-concurrency points size graphs for concurrent AgentX subagents instead of undersized captures.\n> \n> The shared `dsv41flash_fp4_vllm_mtp.sh` script now seeds `--max-cudagraph-capture-size` from optional `DSV41_MIN_CUDAGRAPH_CAPTURE_SIZE` (still doubling up to `CONC * 6` and 2048). The H200 Slurm launcher sets that env to **64** for `dsv41flash` jobs, lifting c1/c2/c4 from 8/16/32 while c8+ behavior is unchanged. Speculative DSpark settings, synthetic AL 3.51, Engram UVA, and trace replay are untouched.\n> \n> Documentation (EN/ZH) and `perf-changelog.yaml` record the H200 recipe change. New pytest coverage in `runners/test_dsv41flash_capture.py` asserts the capture-size matrix and that eval vs throughput speculative config stays correct.\n> \n> <sup>Reviewed by [Cursor Bugbot](https://cursor.com/bugbot) for commit a67a4c52780a5fcd7ce20b154bd28c0b59805f5a. Bugbot is set up for automated code reviews on this repo. Configure [here](https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot).</sup>\n<!-- /CURSOR_SUMMARY -->",
